  "Batch and stream processing answer the same kind of question over different time scales. Batch says: 'here is all of yesterday's data, compute the answer'. Stream says: 'data keeps arriving, keep the answer up to date'. Most companies need both: streams for freshness, batch for correctness, backfills and heavy computation.",
